.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2017/03/19/1255711/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おに魂でお世話になっている古坂さんには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイミングがあわなくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お会い出来なかったのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピコ太郎さんにはお会い出来たので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご挨拶を.....\\( ¨̮ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさか音楽番組で共演する日が来るとは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思ってなかったのでとっても嬉しいです☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ファンの皆さんは勿論"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おに魂リスナーさんにとっても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白い1日になったんじゃないかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーちとPPAPの時ひな壇で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"邪魔にならない程度に体動かして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に踊ってたんだ♡（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対これカメラには映ってないと思う（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑だからこのブログ読んだ人だけだよ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーちに握手会で言ったりしたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりすると思うよ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ねみなみがブログのタイトルにも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"してくれてたんだけど階段降りる時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも「何のポーズにする？｣とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくメンバーと喋るんだけど今回は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとなーくでみなみと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キツネしてみたんだ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑深い意味はな